OL,3,GNEWSANo bathing warning after water in
OL,4,Abrook turns blue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said the EA was in
OL,7,Fcontact with East Devon District
OL,8,FCouncil, the UK Health Security Agency
OL,9,Fand the Animal and Plant Health Agency
OL,10,Fover the incident.
